urem12: x % 12, for x from 0 to 999. Inline: no call.
Listed at cells 10-30, with x in cell 90 and a scratch cell t0 in cell 91.
Copy cells 10-30 to where the program needs x % 12, with each 90 changed to the program's cell for x and each 91 to a free cell; the program goes on with x % 12 in the accumulator.
It overwrites the accumulator and t0; x is kept.
Size 22 cells (21 instructions and t0). It runs 21 instructions, straight through.
Exact over the domain.

